    It happens randomly from the time you kill the Wizard until the end
of the game. There's nothing you can do about it, but here's some
preventative medicine:
- Keep bag of holding blessed. It won't get cursed, it will become
uncursed, at which point it will weigh more and you'll notice.
- Keep lots of holy water and blessed remove curse scrolls so you can
uncurse stuff
- Know blessed/cursed status of important things like blindfold, unicorn
horn, ring of lev, etc. so you don't screw yourself by using them while
they're cursed
I once had my gloves cursed while my lev ring was on, it was in 3.0
in Vlad's Tower, and I couldn't get down the stairs and out. What a 
waste.




